OL,3,ADerry Halloween set for dazzling 40th
OL,4,Aanniversary finale
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people are enjoying the
OL,7,Ffinal day of the Halloween festival in
OL,8,FLondonderry, considered to be the
OL,9,Flargest of its kind in Europe
OL,11,FThe main parade through the city centre
OL,12,Fwill be followed by a spectacular
OL,13,Ffireworks display on the riverfront
OL,15,FPeople from all over the world are in
OL,16,FNorthern Ireland's second city for the
OL,17,Fconclusion of the four-day carnival,
OL,18,Fwhich is marking its 40th anniversary
